  "scope": "Make omitted report, feedback and support feature dependencies selectable before template packaging. Native full-app behavior remains installed.",
  "changes": [
    "Separate native report/feedback submission routes and owner from mandatory profile service.",
    "Separate moderation HTTP controller from other admin capabilities.",
    "Reuse administrator identity and stateless classification without imposing administrator authority on ordinary group-role classification.",
    "Move telemetry batch scoping to administration, preserving one distinct-profile batch lookup.",
    "Separate support creation/case mutation from generic chat, reusing its persistence, stream and counter helpers.",
    "Separate support-case counters from ordinary single/bulk unread updates.",
    "Account status work starts without support; undelivered intent keeps its work marker.",
    "Select admin moderation attention through the existing Optional feature pattern; native numeric fields unchanged, absent feature fields omitted from JSON."
  ],
